OneFit-Engine-ext-florence

This is the public, redistributable copy of the OneFit external model
extensions. From florence 0.3.1 on, it contains no NAG Library code and
no other externally sourced numerical routines whose redistribution
terms were unclear - those have been removed and replaced with
independent reimplementations (see each model's own NOTICE for details,
including the correction for releases 0.1.0 to 0.3.0, which still held
NAG-derived eigenvector normalisation and error-handling code).

A separate, private repository (OneFit-Engine-ext-florence-nag)
holds the original, NAG-derived history for anyone who already holds
the appropriate NAG Library license and prefers the original
implementation. It is not linked from here and is not distributed
alongside this repository; see the top-level README for how to use it
if you have that license.

Consult each models/*/LICENSE and models/*/NOTICE for the specific
license and provenance of that model bundle.
